      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the silence you craved has become a suffocating weight, and that feeling of being trapped is incredibly heavy. A life built for safety can feel like a cage when it stops providing comfort and starts demanding everything. Perhaps the exit doesn't have to be a total collapse; maybe a small, quiet opening is all you need to start seeing a different way out.",
